&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a driven and knowledgeable Individual&amp;nbsp; to lead Payment Gateway (PG) business growth across strategic high potential locations. The ideal candidate will have a strong grasp of the payments ecosystem, hands-on experience working with banks and financial institutions, and the ability to build and leverage government relationships to drive adoption and revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Payment Gateway Sales &amp;amp; Business Development &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Own end-to-end sales of PG solutions to merchants, enterprises, and institutions in the assigned strategic location&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Identify, prospect, and close high-value merchants across sectors such as retail, education, healthcare, and government&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Drive acquisition of new accounts while growing revenue from existing merchant partnerships&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Pitch and position PG products including payment links, UPI, cards, EMI, and BNPL solutions based on merchant needs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bank &amp;amp; Financial Institution Management&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Build and maintain strong relationships with regional and cooperative banks, NBFCs, and nodal banking partners&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Lead commercial negotiations including MDR, settlement cycles, credit limits, and partnership terms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Coordinate with bank partners for faster onboarding, issue resolution, and co-selling opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Stay updated on RBI guidelines, banking circulars, and compliance requirements affecting PG operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Government &amp;amp; Institutional Relationships&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Develop and manage relationships with state and local government bodies, PSUs, and municipalities for PG adoption in public services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Identify and pursue opportunities in government collections — utility payments, tax portals, welfare disbursements, and e-governance projects&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Represent the company in government tenders, RFPs, and empanelment processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Liaise with government officials and decision-makers to position the company as a preferred payments partner&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Negotiation &amp;amp; Deal Structuring &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Lead pricing discussions and commercial structuring for large and strategic deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Collaborate with internal product, risk, and finance teams to create customized proposals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Ensure deal profitability while maintaining competitive positioning in the market&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence &amp;amp; Reporting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Track competitor activity, pricing trends, and emerging merchant needs across assigned strategic locations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Provide regular pipeline reports, forecasts, and market insights to regional leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Represent ground-level feedback to product teams for localization and feature improvements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For Must-&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have Skills &amp;amp; Experience &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;4–8 years of experience in Payment Gateway, Fintech, or Banking sales&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Deep understanding of PG infrastructure — acquiring banks, payment networks, settlement flows, risk &amp;amp; compliance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Proven track record of commercial negotiation with banks or financial institutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Experience managing or engaging with government bodies or PSUs for payments/fintech solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Strong hunter mentality with a consultative sales approach&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Excellent communication, relationship management, and stakeholder influence skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to Have &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Prior experience working in or extensively covering the assigned strategic location&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Existing network of merchants, bank officials, or government contacts in Chandigarh, Lucknow, Chennai, Hyderabad, or Kolkata&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Familiarity with RBI payment regulations, PCI-DSS, and digital payment policies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Understanding of GST, e-invoicing, or government payment use cases&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location - &lt;/strong&gt;Chennai&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_2989597180337834284gmail-m_4972969247898306296gmail-docs-internal-guid-3a65a3c2-7fff-88ff-9e94-8ab11a050d04&quot;&gt;Razorpay believes in and follows an equal employment opportunity policy that doesn&#39;t discriminate on gender, religion, sexual orientation, colour, nationality, age, etc. We welcome interests and applications from all groups and communities across the globe. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_2989597180337834284gmail-m_4972969247898306296gmail-docs-internal-guid-3d0a9248-7fff-a2fd-6fa3-5026f85768d7&quot;&gt;Follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/razorpay/mycompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.linkedin.com/company/razorpay/mycompany/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1660290870959000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0f6sCrv8Ce3IHBvN2Sev8Z&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/Razorpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://twitter.com/Razorpay&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1660290870959000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0ViuP9uutFg1qFCm2nHeh1&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

