&lt;p&gt;But what truly sets Razorpay apart is our culture. At Razorpay, ownership is our oxygen - you own what you build, with no micromanagement or red tape, just the runway to make your ideas fly. Learning is a lifestyle - if you’re curious, you’ll feel at home here. People &amp;gt; Pedigree - we hire for attitude, hustle, and hunger more than degrees. Transparency thrives over titles - this is where interns question CXOs and CXOs say “thank you.” Guided by our values of Customer First, Autonomy &amp;amp; Ownership, Agility with Integrity, Transparency, Challenging the status quo and a strong belief that Razorpay grows with Razors,&amp;nbsp; you’ll be part of a 3000+ strong team building not just products, but the financial infrastructure of the future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Roles and Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;● Ecosystem collaboration: Self-starter to identify and collaborate with ecosystem&amp;nbsp;players to discover and co-build products for the market (Fintechs, Banks, Partners,etc)&lt;br&gt;● Map, develop and drive strong working relationships with key influencers for the&amp;nbsp;assigned banks. It should include mapping the various teams in the assigned banks&amp;nbsp;thoroughly and plot them out to ans organogram of the banks.&lt;br&gt;● Deliver against volume, revenue, penetration and growth targets for the identified&amp;nbsp;and assigned partner banks.&lt;br&gt;● Identifying partnership opportunities within existing/new banking relationships.&lt;br&gt;● Design banking partnerships as a distribution channel for local payments acquiring&amp;nbsp;business, with an aim to scale while owning P&amp;amp;L of north headquartered banks.&lt;br&gt;● Liaising with other cross-functional teams like Solutions, Product etc. to ensure that&amp;nbsp;we deliver on required customizations by sizing up the opportunity and getting it&amp;nbsp;prioritized appropriately&lt;br&gt;● Understand subvention and other applicable models and drive Razorpay’s GTM&amp;nbsp;strategy via bank-led route.&lt;br&gt;● Identify and pitch newer use cases such as Omnichannel (offline+online), Cross&amp;nbsp;border payments, PPI, other solutions - via Bank partnership channel.&lt;br&gt;● Develop implementation plan across alliance life cycle for the assigned portfolio of&amp;nbsp;banks/PSPs&lt;br&gt;● Define and own metrics for monitoring the performance &amp;amp; the effectiveness of&amp;nbsp;existing alliances&lt;br&gt;● Facilitate seamless onboarding of Razorpay as a Vendor / Customer in the bank’s&amp;nbsp;ecosystem as well as ensure set-up on system and its complete alignment across&amp;nbsp;departments&lt;br&gt;● Collaborate with cross-functional stakeholders including leadership, strategy,&amp;nbsp;marketing, and design teams to ensure seamless execution of business launch and&amp;nbsp;scale-up&lt;br&gt;● Ecosystem collaboration: Self-starter to identify and collaborate with ecosystem&amp;nbsp;players to discover and co-build products for the market (Fintechs, Banks, Partners,&amp;nbsp;etc)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Ensuring that the engagements are well formalized with the partner banks by way of&amp;nbsp;agreement(s) and agreed base rates and mark-ups applicable, if any. Also taking&amp;nbsp;care of internal closure with cross-functional departments like Legal, Finance etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mandatory Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;● 2-3 years of overall experience of which 4+ years in Merchant acquiring space with&amp;nbsp;either Payment Gateways, Networks, Banks or Fintech companies.&lt;br&gt;● Established and existing network with banks (public + private) and networks in the&amp;nbsp;North Region.&lt;br&gt;● High energy team player with willingness to learn and adapt quickly&lt;br&gt;● Energetic self-starter with the ability to work independently in a fast-paced&amp;nbsp;environment with proven track record of creating and executing&amp;nbsp;partnerships/alliances that drive measurable business results&lt;br&gt;● Ability to run technical conversations with the bank to drive problem discovery and&amp;nbsp;primary-level solutioning&lt;br&gt;● Analytical capability to deal with the technical, contractual and financial aspects of&amp;nbsp;the business.&lt;br&gt;● Ability to effectively think strategically and influence cross-functional teams, such as&amp;nbsp;Solutions, Product, Operations to drive outsized business outcomes&lt;br&gt;● Willingness to travel regionally to meet with banks/large merchants acquired through&amp;nbsp;the banking partners&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_2989597180337834284gmail-m_4972969247898306296gmail-docs-internal-guid-3a65a3c2-7fff-88ff-9e94-8ab11a050d04&quot;&gt;Razorpay believes in and follows an equal employment opportunity policy that doesn&#39;t discriminate on gender, religion, sexual orientation, colour, nationality, age, etc. We welcome interests and applications from all groups and communities across the globe. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
