&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in managing and working with bigger team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, motivated, hardworking, and self-driven leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interact with stakeholders internal and external is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore automation on all the areas worked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the unit economics of the business and provide insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Month close reporting of Revenue, handling revenue assurance function.&lt;/li&gt;
