&lt;p&gt;High level summary of the role including an overview of the job’s main purpose, who the job holder will report to currently (Principal Engineer - Data Security) and how the job contributes to the organization’s success. Brief description of the team and the impact they make. Some information about the department the role sits within would be helpful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roles and Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build Razopay’s Secure Code Review and Threat Modeling capabilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform Secure Code Review and Threat Modeling on key Razorpay assets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train Security Assessment team on performing Security Code Review and Threat Modeling&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play key role in building scalable, self-serve design review program for dev teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
