&lt;li&gt;Experience working with and extending Static Analysis tools (Semgrep experience is a huge plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good documentation and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a team environment and interact with people&lt;/li&gt;
