&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Regional Manager / Cluster Manager for&lt;a href=&quot;https://razorpay.com?utm_source=chatgpt.com&quot;&gt; &lt;/a&gt;Razorpay POS, you will drive offline sales and point-of-sale payment solutions across a designated geographical region as an individual contributor. This role focuses on accelerating merchant acquisition, expanding offline device deployment, and achieving regional revenue targets through direct business development and strategic merchant engagement. You will work closely with cross-functional teams to strengthen Razorpay’s presence in the offline payments and POS ecosystem while building strong relationships with merchants, channel partners, and enterprise clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Formulate and execute comprehensive regional sales strategies to drive merchant acquisition and scale Razorpay POS device deployment across retail, enterprise, and SME segments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive end-to-end accountability for the region&#39;s P&amp;amp;L, optimizing customer acquisition costs and maximizing device active rates and transaction volumes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Establish and leverage strategic relationships with key channel partners, distributors, and enterprise clients to unlock new offline payment opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Analyze market trends, competitor activities, and real-time transaction data to adapt regional strategies and improve market share.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Mandatory Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;3+ years of proven experience in B2B sales, merchant acquiring, offline payments/POS, or the payments industry,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
