&lt;li&gt;Understanding of FinTech business models (payments, lending, wallets)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regulatory compliance awareness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data analytics and automation mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional collaboration (Finance + Tech + Product)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
